    {
      "displayText": "去年休假时我在伽勒尔地区遇到的\n当地独有的宝可梦们都很有魅力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53BB5E744F11504765F6621157284F3D52D25C145730533A904752307684000A5F53573072EC670976845B9D53EF68A64EEC90FD5F8867099B45529BFF0100100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "尤其是只栖息在铠岛的呆呆兽，\n因为它们的主食是伽勒豆蔻，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以有种刺激性的香味！真让人摸不着头脑！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
