      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把用那个伽勒豆蔻的树枝\n做成的饰品给呆呆兽<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就能让它进化，也真是不可思议！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A752890A34E2A4F3D52D28C46853B76846811679D000A505A62107684997054C17ED954465446517D00100001BE00000A5C3180FD8BA95B838FDB5316FF0C4E5F771F662F4E0D53EF601D8BAEFF0100100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你听好咯。我的呆壳兽们是通过\n我不断收集能在铠岛找到的枝条，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来让呆呆兽进化而成的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
